  "description": "On the Standing See Saw, children ride on their feet. Each end has a blue footrest inside a grey steel hoop, and the child holds the hoop while rocking up and down. Standing makes children use their legs and core to stay balanced, which is a different feel from a seated see saw. It is listed for the 3 to 6 years Key User Group and carries two. The see saw measures 6'10\" x 1'7\" and needs a safe play area of 10'10\" x 5'7\". The hoops give a firm grip all round, so children feel held even while standing. The colour is Knight Blue. Galvanised pipe on this see saw carries our 3-year warranty. Ask us for a layout drawing.",
